[34.938904, "o", "--- NOTE ---\r\n"]
[34.940229, "o", "knit writes a packed mill under /app/jarwell. loom loads every booth class from the exploded tree under /app/blastcp. taste and booth after knit consult that packed mill. The integer in CAP.txt is the packed mill ceiling. Extra slips under /app/slipcards, including /app/slipcards/held.kmsg, follow the same packed-taste rule as the named cards.\r\n"]
[34.940446, "o", "--- brim.sh ---\r\n"]
